    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/4/64496.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 1,
    "turn_text": "I'll tell you, the Prime Minister's speech was well received based on what I could see through our television monitors and listening to the speech as much as we could in the nine o'clock hour, but right there within the United States Congress, our Second District Congressman Chris Stewart was there to see it in person. And Chris, thank you for joining us. And what is your first blush reaction to the speech?",
