        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Having historical support increases perceived power.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Factual support strengthens one's position.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "In this situation, history and facts are on my side.",
        "confidence": 0.9
