    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 64496,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/6/4/64496.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "Boy, it's awfully hard for Iran to escape from the bombastic, blatant, threatening, if not outright, crazy comments that they've made over the years, whether it's Ahmadinejad speaking before the United Nations or whether it's the Ayatollah Khomeini, whomever it might be in leadership in Iran, it's hard for them to run from their words.",
