        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The international community should prioritize preventing nuclear proliferation even if it means enduring short-term risks.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The effectiveness of diplomatic deals depends on credible long-term constraints, not temporary ones.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Iran’s leadership has consistent strategic objectives regarding nuclear capability and regional dominance.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Sanctions are effective tools for influencing state behavior and should not be lifted prematurely.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts the judgment of the Prime Minister on foreign policy matters.",
        "confidence": 0.88
