        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Militant Islamism represents a monolithic ideological force with shared goals despite internal competition.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The legitimacy of statehood is defined by adherence to a specific interpretation of Islamic governance.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "America’s foreign policy is perceived as adversarial toward non-Western Islamist movements.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views regional power struggles through a binary lens of 'us versus them' based on ideology.",
