        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views political power as being tied to moral legitimacy rooted in protection of people.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that the administration’s fear reflects genuine concern over real consequences.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that public discourse should reflect ethical principles rather than strategic alliances.",
